{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_02_021_22",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:78abb36dcb2c54541b57518ca4e6dda1832370f188f3eeaaeb3d17802444af42",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_02_021_22:5_02_021_22_a:cmd-000012:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:947f2b24a05b44f4acfaf4a82dbdb82c13e9b2ecdc161b101c60ec236329aba8",
      "text": "辛苦了。●●●●プロデューサー，\n可以稍微占用一点时间吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_021_22:5_02_021_22_a:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b87c7f886559cd426113cb54c53e219f428ee528beae8965b88c4f95f03b2683",
      "text": "情人节的时候，非常感谢。\n这是谢礼。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_021_22:5_02_021_22_a:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0ad1ed0ea9e11b0aca0da7bb837857291a272819f163c55614612eed02aa2b6a",
      "text": "虽然不知道能不能让你高兴，\n不过我以自己的方式挑选了一下。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_021_22:5_02_021_22_a:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bd63e20ce0e2dcd58dca4aee6dc960f5dbe1b6e5b55183d8c204f380ccf35f5e",
      "text": "不嫌弃的话，请收下吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_021_22:5_02_021_22_a:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d30e9bb1492ece06952b4b8ed7b70d4bc9495b08fec28c97a8a57bbe3b2eb320",
      "text": "今后为了能回应●●●●プロデューサー的\n期待，我也会努力的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_021_22:5_02_021_22_b:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ecb01c23947947acfff0a00b7177d8293c3d572470c152935bc933e32a43ed77",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー。\n辛苦了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_021_22:5_02_021_22_b:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cdfd7a57b5601432477a3db8f48c0b4cd4c3a8f4cb08d27471fa8102ec9b2c27",
      "text": "因为有想给你的东西，\n刚好能遇上真是太好了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_021_22:5_02_021_22_b:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:39997a0f9f5a84368f67b716bf4ff30aad3f8e605d23bc708eaa60ed6e582a24",
      "text": "这个，是情人节的回礼。\n不介意的话请收下吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_021_22:5_02_021_22_b:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ecbf65d90a2ccc4fe52c7c422447a8b9fa7b4d73e373062fe21886bb8c418e07",
      "text": "因为我以前从没送过这样的礼物，\n不知道能不能让你开心……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_021_22:5_02_021_22_b:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:03b219d950b52495524bf37db2b3a08abd2f66564b0bb6e563c388322bcc214d",
      "text": "不过我以自己的方式考虑了\n●●●●プロデューサー的事，选出了这个。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_021_22:5_02_021_22_b:cmd-000031:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:de23c405c7fdc0bfc7f7438d26730757f391cd8965f95468c1f05b91895c5c22",
      "text": "原来是这样啊！总觉得好兴奋呢",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_021_22:5_02_021_22_b:cmd-000032:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fa9a9764c5d28fbbfdd7b18ebf04231d5b5cc67c0296566c39bf8e6af84a55af",
      "text": "非常感谢。让人心跳加速呢",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_021_22:5_02_021_22_b:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3d4251dc667e8804435d64cf74f5ec8d20ca4c2c0ba044a27fa583b74c112fe4",
      "text": "若是能符合你的期待就好了……\n等会儿请拆开看看吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_021_22:5_02_021_22_b:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:012ac1b62cc84e5c7d4be5b165e64576a6ac405b96bb080a2120df82389c9ea2",
      "text": "因为接下来我还有安排，就先告辞了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_021_22:5_02_021_22_b:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a26092f06aa9ee087275fe1b415864851da20872065f2405e0c630d1b274930e",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー，\n接下来的工作也请加油哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
